--- !u!114 &-334616277047347013
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fd78c095813df764ca830b8646311b98, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueMono(Clone)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameTag: Storyteller
  dialogueText: But then, darkness began to envelop Aloria. From deep within the
    Forbidden Forest, an evil force awoke. It was Cthulhu, the Demon Lord of darkness
    and destruction. With an army of terrifying monsters, Cthulhu attacked Aloria,
    spreading terror everywhere.
