--- !u!114 &1672498111044321086
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fd78c095813df764ca830b8646311b98, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueMono(Clone)(Clone)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameTag: Storyteller
  dialogueText: During that fierce battle, a mysterious energy appeared, dividing
    the castle's defense army. We were scattered, each of us in a different place.
    Aloria Castle, our pride, was now covered in darkness.
--- !u!114 &1736734576392083493
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fd78c095813df764ca830b8646311b98, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueMono(Clone)(Clone)(Clone)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameTag: Storyteller
  dialogueText: That is the past, but the pain remains. We must find a way to unite,
    defeat Cthulhu, and reclaim Aloria.
